{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00051",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 5.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "All set here, doctor. Chart's updated, and I'll read the readings out when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.11,
      "end_seconds": 10.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.97,
      "end_seconds": 21.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. It's red scaly patches on my elbows, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.32,
      "end_seconds": 24.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.39,
      "end_seconds": 38.89,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "I've had it for six months. Oh, and stiff fingers in the morning. That's been about the same, two years. Oh, as for stiff fingers in the morning, I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.32,
      "end_seconds": 43.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Has there been scaling on the scalp too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.86,
      "end_seconds": 45.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Yeah, yes, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.29,
      "end_seconds": 46.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.8,
      "end_seconds": 60.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "As for itching, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. So, about itching, I'd say once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.12,
      "end_seconds": 64.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.01,
      "end_seconds": 65.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.23,
      "end_seconds": 82.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any joint swelling or sore throat before it started at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.54,
      "end_seconds": 85.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.21,
      "end_seconds": 89.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Have you had any eye redness, weeping or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.98,
      "end_seconds": 92.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.6,
      "end_seconds": 96.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.04,
      "end_seconds": 100.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Right, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.5,
      "end_seconds": 103.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.17,
      "end_seconds": 105.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.16,
      "end_seconds": 120.65,
      "duration_seconds": 14.49,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.15,
      "end_seconds": 125.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 129.28,
      "end_seconds": 137.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Respiratory rate 17, pulse 65, temperature 36.4, BP is 114 over 71, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.58,
      "end_seconds": 143.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.72,
      "end_seconds": 145.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.32,
      "end_seconds": 149.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.93,
      "end_seconds": 156.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Hmm, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.74,
      "end_seconds": 161.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Right, do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.78,
      "end_seconds": 167.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Yes, I'm allergic to dust. Yes, sulfa drugs. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.74,
      "end_seconds": 173.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.92,
      "end_seconds": 186.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.17,
      "end_seconds": 191.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.66,
      "end_seconds": 204.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I just want to get back to normal, really. Yes, diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.51,
      "end_seconds": 213.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "Alright. Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.02,
      "end_seconds": 217.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "It's amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 219.35,
      "end_seconds": 226.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the amlodipine was 10 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.52,
      "end_seconds": 230.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 230.96,
      "end_seconds": 234.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.48,
      "end_seconds": 237.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.19,
      "end_seconds": 240.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.8,
      "end_seconds": 248.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.19,
      "end_seconds": 253.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.62,
      "end_seconds": 255.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.57,
      "end_seconds": 258.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.47,
      "end_seconds": 276.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "A few small pits in the fingernails."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.36,
      "end_seconds": 279.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Stay still while I have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.27,
      "end_seconds": 297.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Well-defined thick silvery plaques over both elbows and knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.99,
      "end_seconds": 299.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.08,
      "end_seconds": 313.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.54,
      "end_seconds": 317.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.97,
      "end_seconds": 318.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.5,
      "end_seconds": 338.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like plaque psoriasis. Eczema is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.91,
      "end_seconds": 344.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.5,
      "end_seconds": 363.73,
      "duration_seconds": 18.23,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's plaque psoriasis, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had red scaly patches on your elbows for six months, and no fever or weeping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.92,
      "end_seconds": 366.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.21,
      "end_seconds": 389.46,
      "duration_seconds": 20.25,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for baseline before treatment. Let's use calcipotriol-betamethasone gel, once a day, for four weeks. That should help with psoriasis. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. A little sunlight helps psoriasis, but avoid sunburn. Moisturise often. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.63,
      "end_seconds": 406.32,
      "duration_seconds": 15.69,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. We'll refer you to a dermatologist. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.52,
      "end_seconds": 408.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.26,
      "end_seconds": 421.57,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.61,
      "end_seconds": 426.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "So, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 427.68,
      "end_seconds": 431.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.97,
      "end_seconds": 438.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "So, I take the calcipotriol-betamethasone gel, once a day and come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 440.18,
      "end_seconds": 444.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 445.35,
      "end_seconds": 448.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Yeah, nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.33,
      "end_seconds": 453.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}